  "description": "Description: The Nitro Collection Mini Gift Set by Dumont includes 8 mini eau de parfum sprays, each featuring a different Nitro edition (such as Black, Intense, Red, Platinum, White, Blue, Green, and Pour Homme). Each mini bottle is approximately 10 ml (0.34 oz) — perfect for travel, sampling, or gifting. The collection opens with vibrant notes like black currant, bergamot, pineapple and cognac; followed by deeper accords of cinnamon, plum, patchouli, and lavender; and finishes with patchouli, birch, pepper and woods. This set is designed for men who like to switch up their fragrance moods — whether it’s fresh and fruity one day, or rich, spicy and woody the next.",
